      <h1>10 Types of Cotton Hoodie Manufacturers in China: How to Vet Suppliers (2026)</h1>
      <p class="ar-meta">
        <span>By <strong rel="author">YAUUM Sourcing Team</strong></span>
        <span>Published <time datetime="2026-10-07">October 7, 2026</time></span>
      <span class="ar-views" data-views-for="/cotton-hoodie-manufacturer-types-china/" data-views-hit></span>
      </p>
      <p class="ar-lede">Sourcing a 100% cotton hoodie from China should be straightforward. It rarely is. Search "top 10 cotton hoodie manufacturers in China" and you land on a dozen near-identical listicles, each one a thinly veiled ad, none of them telling you how to separate a real factory from a trading company with a good website.</p>
    </div>
